  "slug": "cold-chain-freight-claim-intake-form",
  "title": "Cold Chain Freight Claim Intake Form",
  "subtitle": "Build a decision-ready cold chain claim file from shipment identity, observed loss or damage, determinable amounts, preserved evidence, mitigation, requirements review, and accountable investigation routing.",
  "description": "An original, fillable cold chain freight claim intake form for controlling temperature-controlled consignment and product-integrity record through freight claim intake identity, observations, evidence, decision, exceptions, escalation, completion, handoff, and final verification without replacing applicable requirements or professional review.",
  "use_case": "Use when alleged loss, damage, delay, or expense involving temperature-controlled consignment and product-integrity record must be submitted and triaged without treating an inspection notation, delivery exception, or intake signature as a liability or payment decision.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
